<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4017" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλεξι-φάρμᾰκος</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>acting as antidote</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μανίης</span>
			<i>against</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλεξιφάρμακον, τό</span>, <i>antidote</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.15.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀλεξιφάρμακα</span>, title of
			poem by <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>charm, spell</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐφέσια τοῖς γαμοῦσιν . . γέγων ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					371
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> generally,
				<i>remedy</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>
			<i>against</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				957d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Muson.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				17p.91H.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
